Lemma call_agree (LBc : list (Z * Z)) (sp' scr : Z) M1 M3 : L5C.hpres L LBc sp' scr [] M1 M3 -> PMFR.brange L LBc -> S - 9216 <= sp' - scr -> sp' <= S -> 0 <= scr ->
  forall a m, 0 <= m -> ((sp' <= a /\ a + m <= hl_sptop L) \/ (exists B n, In (B, n) LBc /\ B <= a /\ a + m <= B + n)) -> L5C.agree_on M1 M3 a m.
Proof.
